msgstr "Sensor-Utwahl"

#: SensorBrowser.cc:287
msgid "Drag sensors to empty cells of a worksheet or the panel applet."
msgstr ""
"Treck Sensoren op leddige Feller vun en Arbeitblatt oder op't Paneel-"
